OL,3,GNEWSA'Unacceptable failings' in
OL,4,Ainvestigation into Robert Hamill
OL,5,Amurder, police say
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe "standards expected of policing
OL,8,Fwere not met" in the investigation into
OL,9,Fthe sectarian murder of Robert Hamill,
OL,10,Fthe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,11,F(PSNI) has said.
OL,13,FThe findings of an inquiry into his
OL,14,Fdeath, published on Monday, found that
OL,15,FRoyal Ulster Constabulary (RUC)
OL,16,Fofficers who were in a vehicle near the
OL,17,Fattack did not condone or collude with
OL,18,Fthe attackers.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
