OL,3,GNEWSA'Unacceptable failings' in
OL,4,Ainvestigation into Robert Hamill
OL,5,Amurder, police say
OL,6,
OL,7,FHowever, the inquiry said there were
OL,8,Fmultiple police failings in the
OL,9,Finvestigation, including a tip-off to a
OL,10,Fsuspect to destroy the clothing he wore
OL,11,Fthat night.
OL,13,FRobert Hamill was 25 when he died after
OL,14,Fhe was beaten by loyalists in
OL,15,FPortadown, County Armagh, in 1997.
